#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:25
#: f27a3f21b0854e48a79a7feae8acc9ce
msgid ""
"The top-level clone can use HTTPS. Nested remotes in "
"[`.gitmodules`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-"
"ws/blob/main/.gitmodules) are still `git@github.com:…` (same for nested "
"`.gitmodules` in `arms_ros2_control` and `robot_descriptions`)."
msgstr ""
"顶层克隆可以用 HTTPS。[`.gitmodules`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-"
"deploy-ws/blob/main/.gitmodules) 里的嵌套远程仍是 "
"`git@github.com:…`（`arms_ros2_control` 和 `robot_descriptions` 的嵌套 "
"`.gitmodules` 同样如此）。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:27
#: 477b1beea0ff4b1ea45e8b924907a7ee
msgid "SSH remotes vs HTTPS / `gh`"
msgstr "SSH 远程 vs HTTPS / `gh`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:29
#: 61148efc50464a678ad0a56d8c052b3f
msgid ""
"Machines without an `ssh` binary or GitHub SSH keys fail submodule fetch "
"with `error: cannot run ssh: No such file or directory`."
msgstr ""
"没有 `ssh` 可执行文件或 GitHub SSH 密钥的机器，拉取子模块会失败：`error: cannot run ssh: No such"
" file or directory`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:31
#: a00ae229a27e4f7490533744a4320dd6
msgid ""
"`git config url.https://github.com/.insteadOf git@github.com:` **alone is"
" not enough** for `git submodule update`. Nested repos read their own "
"`.gitmodules` and invoke `ssh` directly."
msgstr ""
"仅设置 `git config url.https://github.com/.insteadOf git@github.com:` "
"**不够**让 `git submodule update` 走通。嵌套仓会读自己的 `.gitmodules`，并直接调用 `ssh`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:33
#: 9e65333a7cb54bf0aa70ca782038fa58
msgid ""
"The `init_repo.sh` in [open-deploy-ws#8](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/open-deploy-ws/pull/8) rewrites GitHub `git@` URLs in `.gitmodules` to "
"HTTPS, runs `submodule sync` / `update`, then restores `.gitmodules` (so "
"the working tree is not left dirty). That path runs when `ssh` is "
"missing, when public mode has no usable key, or when you pass `--https` /"
" `OPEN_DEPLOY_GIT_HTTPS=1`. After #8 merges — or once you pull an "
"`init_repo.sh` that has these flags — prefer:"
msgstr ""
"[open-deploy-ws#8](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws/pull/8)"
" 里的 `init_repo.sh` 会把 `.gitmodules` 中的 GitHub `git@` URL 改写成 HTTPS，执行 "
"`submodule sync` / `update`，再还原 `.gitmodules`（工作区不会留下脏改动）。在没有 "
"`ssh`、public 模式没有可用密钥、或传入 `--https` / `OPEN_DEPLOY_GIT_HTTPS=1` 时走这条路径。#8"
" 合入之后 — 或已拉到带这些参数的 `init_repo.sh` — 优先："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:35
#: 891ba00f0ecd4acea4716704e329b7ec
msgid ""
"./init_repo.sh --public --ocs2=deb --arms=source --common=source\n"
"# force HTTPS even if ssh exists:\n"
"./init_repo.sh --public --https --ocs2=deb --arms=source --common=source"
msgstr ""
"./init_repo.sh --public --ocs2=deb --arms=source --common=source\n"
"# force HTTPS even if ssh exists:\n"
"./init_repo.sh --public --https --ocs2=deb --arms=source --common=source"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:41
#: fd21d71163234168aa128b06cc907269
msgid ""
"`./init_repo.sh --help` lists the rest. Hosts that already have SSH keys "
"(especially for private nested modules) keep the original SSH URLs unless"
" `--https` is set."
msgstr ""
"`./init_repo.sh --help` 列出其余参数。已有 SSH 密钥的主机（尤其是 private 嵌套）保持原来的 SSH "
"URL，除非加了 `--https`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:43
#: c8c2cc7b576a4ffa9cbd010e794f91c4
msgid ""
"**Older `init_repo.sh` (no `--https` / no CLI flags):** clone public "
"remotes over HTTPS, or `gh repo clone <org/name>` with GitHub CLI auth:"
msgstr ""
"**旧版 `init_repo.sh`（没有 `--https` / 没有命令行参数）：** 用 HTTPS 克隆公开远程，或用已登录的 "
"GitHub CLI 执行 `gh repo clone <org/name>`："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:45
