msgid "`cannot run ssh` / Access Denied to Submodule"
msgstr "`cannot run ssh` / 子模块拒绝访问"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:304
#: 994e9fc1b0ad4fb2816722ebdbc1b9ba
msgid ""
"`.gitmodules` URLs are SSH. `insteadOf` HTTPS rewrite alone does not fix "
"`git submodule update`. After [open-deploy-ws#8](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws/pull/8) (or once you pull that "
"`init_repo.sh`), the script rewrites `.gitmodules` to HTTPS for the fetch"
" and restores it afterwards — use `--https` / `OPEN_DEPLOY_GIT_HTTPS=1` "
"to force that. Older scripts: HTTPS / `gh` clone fallback above."
msgstr ""
"`.gitmodules` 的 URL 是 SSH。仅靠 `insteadOf` 改写成 HTTPS 不能修好 `git submodule "
"update`。[open-deploy-ws#8](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-"
"ws/pull/8) 合入后（或已拉到该 `init_repo.sh`），脚本会在拉取时把 `.gitmodules` 改写成 "
"HTTPS，结束后再还原 — 用 `--https` / `OPEN_DEPLOY_GIT_HTTPS=1` 强制走这条路径。旧版脚本：用上面的 "
"HTTPS / `gh` 克隆回退。"

